Speaker headshots.

Filenames must match photo_path in the panel seeders exactly, because
PanelSpeaker::photoUrl() checks the file exists and silently falls back to a
generated initials avatar if it does not — a typo shows no error, just the
wrong picture.

Panel 3:
    bola-soko.jpg
    celestine-achi.jpg
    grace-lawalson.jpg
    joshua-adeleke.jpg

Square, 400x400 or larger, ideally under 100KB. No deploy needed: the page
picks up a new file on the next request.
